menu "WiFi Dap core (CMSIS-DAP command engine)"

    config BIRDIEBOT_DAP_STATS
        bool "Enable DAP core profiling counters + Vendor9 stats command"
        default n
        help
            Debug-only instrumentation for OpenOCD/elaphureLink throughput work.

            Counts per-command processing time and the gap between consecutive
            host commands (transport round trip), the command-type histogram,
            0x7E/0x7F batch statistics, SWD transfer count and
            DAP_TransferBlock word counts.  A CMSIS-DAP Vendor9 command
            (0x89, sub-command 1 = snapshot, 0 = reset) returns the counters so
            a host-side raw-DAP client (elaphureLink port 3240) can read them
            remotely without serial console access.

            Production builds keep this disabled: no counters, no time reads,
            no Vendor9 handler.

endmenu
